          ],
          "before": "Published q-compromise pressure approximation, with theta0 and gamma/V constant and no q parameter. V0 is adopted/fixed from Holland and Powell (2011); it is not an ambient-volume refit or a direct measurement. Source-file coefficients preserve more digits than Table 1. Marginal data bounds do not define phase stability or a validated rectangle. The model supplies P-V-T, pressure derivatives and parameter uncertainty, not a caloric potential or mixing model. The official supplements contain final EOS/covariance files and Tables S1/S2 of dataset selections, not the complete numerical mixed volume/adiabatic-modulus input project. Exact point masks, rescalings, weights and the original refinement are not replayed. Recovered grossular observations and a conditional 95-channel diagnostic are retained separately; they are not the original joint fit input. See docs/literature-reproductions/grossular-angel-2022.md.",
